# The tree's wind on a probe (reports/engine/2026-11-16-modern-trees/tree-wind.md): six rough spruces of 12 m on
# the meadow east of the tavern, built by scripts/content/tree_wind_probe.py; run with OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<that
# set>. Stills only: `far`, 26 m west of the first spruce and 5.3 m over its root, at the peak of a gust and
# `far-lull` in the calm after it; `shade`, from the east back at the spruces, and `near`, 5 m from its trunk, up
# into the two lower tiers, each at a next peak. The world's wind blows along +Z, across the views: to the left in
# `far` and `near`, to the right in `shade`. The sun of 10:00 is behind the far camera and to its side, and the
# shadows fall east, down a slope the far view does not see: `shade` is the still that shows them. Its camera
# stands 5.5 m over that slope, 8 to 17 m from the tips of the shadows, under the crown of the original tree at
# (42681, -352): the crown is 30 m wide and hides the slope from above, and the tops of some spruces from here.
# The cameras stand by SPOTS of the script: change both together. The far one is as far as the meadow lets it: the
# original fir at (38350, 44) is behind it, the one at (39318, -591) to its right.
# Run it twice in the same window and compare the stills of one name (the tree at rest | in the wind):
#   OPENGOTHIC_FOLIAGE=0 OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<set> TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=2560x1440 BENCH_HOST=ryzen scripts/bench.sh tree-wind-probe
#                        OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<set> TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=2560x1440 BENCH_HOST=ryzen scripts/bench.sh tree-wind-probe
# @timeout 600
seed 73013
cheat god
overlay off
ui off
view full
set time 10 0

# the hero stands aside of the first view
goto pos 38450 3790 -600
clear 3000
streaming wait
cam at 38750 3900 300 41300 3950 0
wait 5000
foliage wait-gust 1500 0
wait 1500
shot far
wait 200
foliage wait-lull 1500 0
wait 1500
shot far-lull
wait 200

cam at 43300 3520 1100 41900 3330 350
wait 2000
foliage wait-gust 1500 0
wait 1500
shot shade
wait 200

goto pos 40700 3420 -500
streaming wait
cam at 40800 3545 0 41300 3825 0
wait 4000
foliage wait-gust 1500 0
wait 1500
shot near
wait 200
